                                "sense_id": "c4ba3c41-e214-31ea-af50-9759f8daaaf8",
                                "text": "Humble positivism allowed educators, politicians, or religious authorities to believe, and behave as if, they possess superscientific knowledge that reaches further into the fabric of reality than empirical science."
